Bible Scripture data
-------------------
The English King James Version (KJV) and the Arabic Smith–Van Dyke (AVD, 1865)
are public domain. Both 66-book datasets are sourced from
https://github.com/midvash/bible-data at revision
d9fe1779447717bbfcb578e505b893125cad581c. Provenance, source URLs, and checksums
are in data/bible/kjv-source.json and data/bible/avd-source.json, described in docs/DATA.md.
Commentary and Scripture are separate works. Per-verse commentary chunks are a
mechanical split of the same commentary text for navigation; they do not
relicense it. The New King James Version (NKJV) is not included.
